Package: panettone
Title: zero-shot time-series forecasting with tabular foundation models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("frank", "hull", email = "frankiethull@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adapts tabular in-context learners (TabICL, TabPFN, Fiorino)
    into time-series forecasters. A shared temporal feature engine turns
    each series into supervised tabular regression problems
    (calendar/trend/seasonal features, optional lags); swappable backend
    adapters translate the feature table into each engine's native
    fit/predict interface. Mirrors the 'PriorLabs/tabpfn-time-series'
    pipeline design, generalized beyond a single engine.
